      "items": [
        "Plugin local_testcase_exchange uses Jobe REST API directly for teacher code execution",
        "CodeRunner dispatches student code and test cases to the same isolated Jobe Sandbox cluster",
        "Both flows run completely isolated in Linux cgroups without touching Moodle host container"
      ]
